{
  "title": "99: al-Zalzalah الزلزلة",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful\nاِذَا زُلْزِلَتِ الْاَرْضُ زِلْزَالَهَا ۙ‏(1)\nEZAA ZULZELATIL ARZO ZILZAALAHAA.\nWhen the earth shall quake with her (terrible) quaking\nوَاَخْرَجَتِ الْاَرْضُ اَثْقَالَهَا ۙ‏(2)\nWA AKHRAJATIL ARZO ASQAALAHAA.\nAnd the earth bringeth forth her burdens\nوَقَالَ الْاِنْسَانُ مَا لَهَا ۚ‏(3)\nWA QAALAL INSAANO MAA LAHAA.\nAnd man shall say: ‘‘What hath happened to her?\nيَوْمَئِذٍ تُحَدِّثُ اَخْبَارَهَا ۙ‏(4)\nYAWMAEZIN TOHADDESO AKHBAARAHAA.\nOn that day she shall relate her news (about all that happened on her)\nبِاَنَّ رَبَّكَ اَوْحٰى لَهَا ؕ‏(5)\nBE-ANNA RABBAKA AWHAA LAHAA.\nThat thy Lord hath revealed unto her\nيَوْمَئِذٍ يَّصْدُرُ النَّاسُ اَشْتَاتًا ۙ لِّيُرَوْا اَعْمَالَهُمْؕ‏(6)\nYAWMAEZIN-Y YASDORUN NAASO ASHTAATAL, LEYORAW A-A’MAALAHUM.\nOn that day shall come out people (from their graves) in (scattered) groups, to be shown their own deeds\nفَمَنْ يَّعْمَلْ مِثْقَالَ ذَرَّةٍ خَيْرًا يَّرَهٗ ؕ‏(7)\nFAMAN-Y YA’MAL MISQAALA ZAARATIN KHAYRAN-Y YARAH.\nThen he who hath done an atom-weight of good shall See it\nوَمَنْ يَّعْمَلْ مِثْقَالَ ذَرَّةٍ شَرًّا يَّرَهٗ‏(8)\nWA MAN-Y YA’MAL MISQAALA ZARRATIN SHARRAN-Y YARAH.\nAnd he who hath done an atom-weight of evil shall see it",
  "merits": "This Surah was revealed in Madinah and it has 8 verses. It is narrated from Imam Ja’far al-Sadiq (a.s.) that whoever recites this Surah in his recommended prayers will not die as a result of an earthquake and will be saved from all the natural calamities.\nThe experience of death is made easy for the one who recites this Surah and he sees the light of Jannah as he is about to die. Then, seventy thousand angels accompany his soul to the heavens. Keeping this Surah in one’s possession is a safety from tyrant rulers."
